                  Karlin.FaithfulClock.height P.b (P.entry (q + 1)) -
                      Karlin.FaithfulClock.height P.b (Karlin.wordScore P.A (P.entry q) (List.take r (P.word q))) ≤
                    Karlin.FaithfulEffectiveContract.decodeRat input * ↑((P.word q).length - r) + P.Arem
